{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34772","headline":"奉和陆鲁望白菊 · 郑璧","name":"奉和陆鲁望白菊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白艳轻明带露痕，始知佳色重难羣。\n终朝疑笑梁王雪，尽日慵飞蜀帝魂。\n燕雨似翻瑶渚浪，雁风疑卷玉绡纹。\n琼妃若会宽裁剪，堪作蟾宫夜舞裙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑璧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34772.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34772","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}